# =============================================================================
#  What never goes into the image
# =============================================================================
#  This file is a security control, not an optimisation. Without it `COPY . .`
#  copies .env.local — every secret this application has — and backups/, which
#  holds patient records, into a layer that anybody who can pull the image can
#  read back. Both are gitignored; neither is dockerignored by that.
# =============================================================================

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backups/

.git
.github
.gitignore

node_modules
.next
out

# Nothing below is needed to run the app, and each one is a reason to rebuild
# a layer that did not change.
tests
*.md
Jenkinsfile
# Server set-up files (bootstrap, the database stack): used on the server, never in the image.
deploy/
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
*.log
